AltoStaking::emergencySweep()
├── given contract is not paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── given valid conditions (contract paused and caller is owner)
    ├── when contract has balance
    │   ├── it should transfer all contract balance to owner
    │   ├── it should emit EmergencySweep event
    │   └── it should leave contract with zero balance
    ├── when contract has no balance
    │   ├── it should emit EmergencySweep event with zero amount
    │   └── it should not change owner balance
    ├── when called multiple times
    │   └── it should work each time transferring current balance
    ├── when called after partial unlocks
    │   └── it should transfer remaining balance after unlocks
    └── when testing precise balance calculations
        └── it should transfer exact amounts accurately 